**Entry:** Remote pages and local files in the browser — a remote page's favicon and its navigation to a `file:` URL
read no local file (`chk-ih277nx6`, escher-0.3.0, Epoch 4 — Determinism and exploration, its last markerless entry;
this chunk's wrap is the Epoch 4 boundary wrap).

- No carrier, verb, argument, cause, session error, exit, log field, span, env read, listener or dependency is added;
  a refused favicon or navigation is simply not started, so no error path and no log line is reached at all. Verified
  at P3: the refusals are a filter and an early return, no `tracing` call.
